how's it going everybody it's warren  welcome back to the cosmic wonder where  we talk all things marvel cinematic  universe and over the weekend there was  a  crazy report that came out stating that  jennifer  lawrence has been cast for the mcu's  sue storm aka the invisible woman  of the fantastic four a huge report if  true and we're gonna dive into it and  thank you to skillshare for sponsoring  this video more in them in a bit now a  few months ago at disney's investor day  kevin feige did talk about the fantastic  four he said the movie is  in development and they're working on a  feature right now  but this report not only says that  jennifer lawrence has been cast  as sue storm but she is actually on her  way to australia to film a scene  and this does seem a little bit early to  be shooting for the fantastic four but  according to a different report  the scene that she is shooting is  actually not for the fantastic  four it's for a different mcu film now  there's a lot being discussed about  these reports online with all the  insider trades and i'm gonna break down  each report and everything you need to  know so let's start with the first one  but first if you love marvel be sure to  subscribe so you don't miss out on any  of the latest mcu videos  now we know that thor love and thunder  is filming in australia and according to  a report  from the daily telegraph marvel studios  is also planning on using this set in  australia to film the fantastic  four not only that but the daily  telegraph also reported that jennifer  lawrence  is already on her way there to film it  the website daily mail also stated that  jennifer lawrence is involved in a  marvel project  and a couple of days ago  geekocitymag.com also reported that  jennifer lawrence was being eyed  for an mcu role now jennifer lawrence is  a  huge actress a very high profile actress  so she's not just going to play  any role in a film she's not going to  play a minor role in a marvel studios  film so of course what everybody is  saying and what has been coming out over  the weekend  is that she is going to be playing sue  storm the invisible woman which of  course makes perfect sense  and she does kind of fit the description  pretty well for a sue  storm now of course it does seem like it  would be a little bit early to start  filming for a fantastic four  film especially if you consider the fact  that kevin feige the president of marvel  studios during the investor day  said that john watts the director of the  spider-man homecoming films is also  going to be directing the fantastic four  films and right now he's in the middle  of shooting spider-man homecoming 3.  so the fact that they're saying jennifer  is involved with the fantastic four and  is going to film right now  seems a little bit premature and in fact  justin krull from deadline tweeted this  morning stating  all i'm gonna say is this marvel just  started meeting with writers on  fantastic four there's no script and it  will be a while before the film starts  shooting  now interestingly enough he did not  comment on the jennifer lawrence report  he commented on the filming which means  that jennifer lawrence still could very  well have been cast  as the invisible woman and according to  geekgossitymag.com jennifer lawrence  could be going to australia right now to  possibly shoot a post-credits scene  for thor 11 thunder which is shooting  there currently now since the marvel  writers  are meeting right now that means they  are considering or have  already considered who exactly they want  to play the fantastic four members  what kevin feige the president of marvel  studios tends to do  is meet with actors and actresses years  and years in advance before  finally arriving at a role that would be  really perfect for an  actor they did this with jake gyllenhaal  they met with him about plenty of marvel  films before deciding that mysterio was  the perfect character for him  and not too long ago he admitted that he  meets with keanu reeves about every  single marvel film they make  to see if there's a character that would  work unfortunately there has not been a  character that would work for keanu  reeves in the marvel cinematic universe  yet but it is safe to assume that marvel  studios  if they wanted jennifer lawrence has  been meeting with her for some time now  and of course she does have major  connections to marvel as she played  mystique  in the fox x-men series which is another  thing that if this report is true makes  you wonder about this decision  for her to play the invisible woman  she's already played mystique in another  marvel universe and spoiler warning  upcoming for  one division click away now if you're  trying to avoid any they already brought  evan peters's quicksilver back  and fans are very confused right now now  granted they have a master plan and it's  all going to be revealed in the next  couple of episodes but it doesn't really  seem like marvel is that worried  about the confusion aspect as long as  you have a good story and can play it  off properly or have a good character in  mind for that actor  now another thing i'll talk about is  emily blunt and john krasinski but first  thank you to skillshare for sponsoring  this video  and again thank you to skillshare for  sponsoring this video  skillshare is an online learning  community with thousands of inspiring  classes for  creative and curious people over the  last year i've used skillshare myself  watching videos on youtube watching  videos about photoshop and other film  editing software programs and i've used  it personally as well such as watching  videos on how to play the guitar and how  to get better  if you are looking for a place to  explore your creativity or to simply get  better at things  such as youtube or editing or playing an  instrument skillshare is the perfect  place to learn all of these things  and the great news is is that the first  thousand of my subscribers to click on  the link in my description will get a  free trial of skillshare premium so you  can explore your creativity  and if you're not one of the first  thousands don't worry it's only ten  dollars a month with an annual  subscription so it's very very  affordable if you're interested in  youtube classes you can check out the  teacher sorel  amore just click the link in the  description down below to get started  now a lot of the fandom right now really  wants emily blunt and john krasinski to  play sue storm and reed richards they  both  absolutely look the part and reed and  sue are married in the comics and  jon and emily are married in real life  and we know that marvel studios has  indeed met with both emily blunt and  john krasinski but perhaps this  is another jake gyllenhaal thing perhaps  they meet with them about a lot of  different marvel studios projects until  they find that perfect  role for them now again justin crowe  from deadline said that the script isn't  even written yet but he didn't mention  anything about jennifer lawrence so take  this report with a grain of salt and may  be true it may not be true but either  way  let me know in the comments down below  if you would like it to be true  be sure to subscribe so you don't miss  out on any of the latest videos and i'll  update you if we hear any more about  this report don't forget to like the  video and for live updates you can  follow me on instagram and twitter  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof  me

